the project & repository.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.0.0/) 
and this projeect adheres to 
[Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).

## Unreleased

### Added
- Created the basic framework of the repository. 
- Set up a basic MkDocs config file so the documents can be easily 
